{
	"_comment": "Single source of truth for remote LLM API providers and per-model pricing. Both drivers (AHK api_remote.ahk and HS api_remote.lua) load this file at boot — add a provider here first, then reload the driver. `format` is openai, anthropic, gemini, backboard (Backboard's assistant/thread API, key in X-API-Key, models written <llm_provider>/<model_name>) or decisions (TypeSafe's System One protocol: typed questions in, answers with probabilities out; base_url is the full endpoint and the key goes in Authorization: Bearer). A decisions provider serves Jev, which is not a chat model: it is offered only as the agent's System 1. The request shapes of backboard and decisions live in _shared/lua/llm/remote_formats.lua.",
	"provider_order": [
		"openai",
		"anthropic",
		"gemini",
		"xai",
		"mistral",
		"deepseek",
		"cohere",
		"cerebras",
		"openrouter",
		"groq",
		"together",
		"fireworks",
		"backboard",
		"typesafe",
		"openrouter_jev",
		"openai_compat"
	],
